1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:03,336
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,464
[tense music playing]

3
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:21,646
[screaming]

4
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,773
[shattering sound]

5
00:00:27,318 --> 00:00:31,740
[Lily] <i>Don't let your hatred</i>
<i>cloud your principles.</i>

6
00:00:31,823 --> 00:00:37,871
<i>Killing other people won't give you</i>
<i>the justice that you want.</i>

7
00:00:37,954 --> 00:00:39,581
[Diego] <i>I'm not the same</i>
<i>Diego Torillo you knew.</i>

8
00:00:39,664 --> 00:00:41,499
<i>And I'll never be that man again.</i>

9
00:00:41,583 --> 00:00:43,710
<i>Now, I've realized</i>
<i>that the world is a cruel place,</i>

10
00:00:43,793 --> 00:00:45,545
<i>and principles have no place in it.</i>

11
00:00:45,628 --> 00:00:48,006
<i>And if you're going to stop me,</i>
<i>then best we go our separate ways.</i>

12
00:00:48,089 --> 00:00:51,843
<i>Those pests who were</i>
<i>protecting Diego are now dead.</i>

13
00:00:51,926 --> 00:00:56,890
<i>And Lily Cruz now knows that</i>
<i>Helena Montoya is Red Dragon.</i>

14
00:00:56,973 --> 00:01:00,351
[man] <i>All the witnesses from</i>
<i>Camia Cruz's camp have backed out.</i>

15
00:01:00,435 --> 00:01:03,688
[Georgina] <i>We have to secure an advantage</i>
<i>before Julio's camp does.</i>

16
00:01:03,772 --> 00:01:05,815
[Lily] <i>And the evidence</i>
<i>against Red Dragon?</i>

17
00:01:05,899 --> 00:01:07,859
<i>All evidences are admissible in court.</i>

18
00:01:07,942 --> 00:01:08,860
<i>We need a…</i>

19
00:01:08,943 --> 00:01:09,819
<i>Credible witness.</i>

20
00:01:09,903 --> 00:01:12,197
[Lily] <i>Tell me everything you know</i>

21
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:14,616
<i>that could serve as evidence</i>
<i>against Red Dragon.</i>

22
00:01:14,699 --> 00:01:17,577
[Myla] <i>Now that Red Dragon</i>
<i>knows you know her identity,</i>

23
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,079
<i>she can take everything away from us.</i>

24
00:01:19,162 --> 00:01:20,663
[Lily] <i>If I don't get to her first.</i>

25
00:01:20,747 --> 00:01:23,625
[Raul] <i>I'll uncover your</i>
<i>mother's secrets eventually.</i>

26
00:01:23,708 --> 00:01:25,502
<i>But for now, my son needs me.</i>

27
00:01:25,585 --> 00:01:30,298
[Lily] <i>In every letter and every detail,</i>
<i>I study my enemy.</i>

28
00:01:30,381 --> 00:01:33,885
<i>In turn, their strength</i>
<i>becomes mine as well.</i>

29
00:01:33,968 --> 00:01:35,845
<i>Such is the art of war.</i>

30
00:01:35,929 --> 00:01:37,514
[Diego] <i>I'm looking for Sanggano.</i>

31
00:01:37,597 --> 00:01:39,182
[Raul] <i>Why? What do</i>
<i>you want with Sanggano?</i>

32
00:01:39,265 --> 00:01:40,558
[Diego] <i>I'm going to kill him.</i>

33
00:01:40,642 --> 00:01:42,602
[Jose] <i>Can you? You don't have the guts!</i>

34
00:01:42,685 --> 00:01:43,436
[grunts]

35
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,354
[gunshot]

36
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:53,071
Lily.

37
00:01:55,281 --> 00:01:56,032
Jepoy.

38
00:01:56,491 --> 00:01:57,534
I've got news.

39
00:01:58,618 --> 00:02:00,411
Sanggano was found dead.

40
00:02:00,745 --> 00:02:01,496
What?!

41
00:02:01,913 --> 00:02:03,248
[Camia] Where?

42
00:02:03,331 --> 00:02:05,083
At a beer house near town.

43
00:02:08,169 --> 00:02:08,920
Lily.

44
00:02:10,296 --> 00:02:11,548
Someone informed me

45
00:02:11,631 --> 00:02:14,008
that the person who killed
Sanggano was Diego himself.

46
00:02:14,092 --> 00:02:15,927
[dramatic music playing]

47
00:02:16,010 --> 00:02:16,928
Diego?

48
00:02:18,054 --> 00:02:20,181
He would never do such a thing.

49
00:02:31,401 --> 00:02:33,403
[dramatic music continues playing]

50
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:42,871
That idiot!

51
00:02:42,954 --> 00:02:43,705
[glass breaking]

52
00:02:45,874 --> 00:02:49,711
To call Colonel Sanggano "stupid"…

53
00:02:50,420 --> 00:02:53,715
would be an insult to stupid people!

54
00:02:54,132 --> 00:02:55,884
Of all ways to die,

55
00:02:56,426 --> 00:02:58,970
he chose a truly pathetic one,

56
00:02:59,971 --> 00:03:01,389
if he had a choice at all!

57
00:03:03,516 --> 00:03:07,061
How am I going to move
without a right-hand man?

58
00:03:07,604 --> 00:03:09,981
And you're like a bunch
of stupid headless chickens

59
00:03:10,064 --> 00:03:11,149
without your leader.

60
00:03:11,649 --> 00:03:14,652
But, Governor, Sanggano's
killer wasn't just anybody.

61
00:03:15,028 --> 00:03:17,405
Oh really? Humor me.

62
00:03:17,488 --> 00:03:21,951
Who? Who's the wise guy
who killed Sanggano?

63
00:03:22,035 --> 00:03:22,952
Tell me!

64
00:03:23,036 --> 00:03:24,162
Diego Torillo.

65
00:03:24,621 --> 00:03:27,582
[ominous music playing]

66
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:29,626
[scoffs]

67
00:03:32,378 --> 00:03:33,171
That…

68
00:03:34,756 --> 00:03:38,134
now that's definitely news to me.

69
00:03:40,428 --> 00:03:42,222
Diego Torillo?

70
00:03:45,975 --> 00:03:52,440
A man with a clean conscience
is capable of committing murder?

71
00:03:54,609 --> 00:03:57,779
Diego Torillo committing murder.

72
00:04:00,907 --> 00:04:02,992
This is unbelievable.

73
00:04:05,703 --> 00:04:06,621
[chuckles]

74
00:04:10,959 --> 00:04:14,921
You should be on your guard,
Governor. You could be next.

75
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:19,217
Don't be silly, boy.

76
00:04:20,510 --> 00:04:22,971
As if I'd put my tail between my legs.

77
00:04:23,429 --> 00:04:24,180
Hey.

78
00:04:24,555 --> 00:04:30,728
I'd rather die laughing than
fear someone like Diego Torillo.

79
00:04:31,771 --> 00:04:33,314
Too many people have tried to kill me.

80
00:04:34,524 --> 00:04:36,901
I'm not scared of a newbie like him.

81
00:04:39,779 --> 00:04:41,155
Diego Torillo?

82
00:04:45,118 --> 00:04:49,080
Oh, Raul. Have you heard
what happened to Sanggano?

83
00:04:49,664 --> 00:04:50,581
He died!

84
00:04:50,873 --> 00:04:52,000
And guess who killed him!

85
00:04:52,083 --> 00:04:55,837
It's your own bastard son, Diego Torillo!

86
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,463
I didn't expect that he could do it,

87
00:04:57,547 --> 00:04:59,549
but I guess, he had it in him.

88
00:04:59,966 --> 00:05:03,469
You know, Emilia, anyone who's
been pushed to a corner…

89
00:05:04,053 --> 00:05:05,138
can do the impossible.

90
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:09,517
Wow! Really? Coming from you?
Wow, I can't believe it.

91
00:05:09,892 --> 00:05:11,728
But you know,
I feel the same way now because

92
00:05:11,811 --> 00:05:16,190
I feel so blind-sided by Mama
and her witch of an assistant.

93
00:05:17,567 --> 00:05:20,403
And you really think my son's experience

94
00:05:21,029 --> 00:05:23,489
compares to all
the pointless things you do?

95
00:05:24,032 --> 00:05:24,991
[sighing]

96
00:05:25,074 --> 00:05:26,367
You're unbelievable, Emilia.

97
00:05:27,368 --> 00:05:30,288
[somber music playing]

98
00:05:30,955 --> 00:05:32,373
Now I'm unbelievable?

99
00:05:33,499 --> 00:05:35,460
[engine running]

100
00:05:50,391 --> 00:05:53,019
According to the news,
Sanggano was last seen here.

101
00:05:53,644 --> 00:05:54,896
Diego could be in the area.

102
00:05:55,646 --> 00:05:57,023
Okay, I'll look around.

103
00:05:57,273 --> 00:05:58,691
I'll come with you, Miss Camia.

104
00:05:59,108 --> 00:06:00,151
Thanks, Jepoy.

105
00:06:00,568 --> 00:06:04,197
[dramatic piano music playing]

106
00:06:18,544 --> 00:06:22,548
[ominous music playing]

107
00:07:02,338 --> 00:07:06,342
[dramatic music playing]

108
00:07:32,994 --> 00:07:33,870
[wood breaking]

109
00:07:33,953 --> 00:07:36,164
[ominous sound playing]

110
00:07:36,247 --> 00:07:40,168
[dramatic music continues]

111
00:07:51,679 --> 00:07:52,430
Mom.

112
00:07:53,055 --> 00:07:55,349
Lily. Did you find him?

113
00:07:56,434 --> 00:07:57,852
[somber piano music playing]

114
00:07:58,603 --> 00:08:01,147
Let's check Mrs. Loring's house.

115
00:08:01,856 --> 00:08:03,107
He's not there, Mom.

116
00:08:03,483 --> 00:08:04,942
But even if he doesn't show up,

117
00:08:06,235 --> 00:08:08,070
I know he's around here.

118
00:08:11,908 --> 00:08:13,618
Lily, don't give up on him.

119
00:08:16,204 --> 00:08:17,079
Come on, Diego.

120
00:08:17,330 --> 00:08:20,500
Everyone came here to find you.
Everyone's worried about you.

121
00:08:20,583 --> 00:08:21,501
Come with us.

122
00:08:21,584 --> 00:08:22,919
I'm not coming with you.

123
00:08:23,002 --> 00:08:24,504
Are you nuts, Diego?

124
00:08:24,670 --> 00:08:27,882
Julio Ardiente will have you
killed for killing Sanggano!

125
00:08:27,965 --> 00:08:29,050
You know that, right?

126
00:08:29,133 --> 00:08:30,760
I'm not afraid to die.

127
00:08:33,179 --> 00:08:34,013
You know what?

128
00:08:34,263 --> 00:08:35,932
I really do want to join you

129
00:08:36,015 --> 00:08:38,643
because I want to retaliate
with force and violence.

130
00:08:39,352 --> 00:08:42,313
But you stopped me back then
because you knew it was wrong!

131
00:08:43,773 --> 00:08:44,941
Just come with us!

132
00:08:45,024 --> 00:08:47,777
And you once told me
that we can't take down

133
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:50,947
the Ardientes the right way,
but with force.

134
00:08:51,197 --> 00:08:52,698
And now that I've gone down that path,

135
00:08:52,782 --> 00:08:55,076
I can't come with you
because you'll get involved.

136
00:08:55,868 --> 00:08:58,955
And if you really care
about Lily and the others,

137
00:08:59,372 --> 00:09:01,415
you won't say a word about this.

138
00:09:04,752 --> 00:09:06,045
[tense music playing]

139
00:09:06,128 --> 00:09:06,879
Diego…

140
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:15,596
[door opens]

141
00:09:22,728 --> 00:09:23,479
[door closes]

142
00:09:26,566 --> 00:09:27,775
Have you found Diego?

143
00:09:30,027 --> 00:09:31,028
Not yet.

144
00:09:33,447 --> 00:09:35,324
I'm sorry it took me a while to come home.

145
00:09:36,325 --> 00:09:38,536
I heard what happened to Diego…

146
00:09:39,620 --> 00:09:41,247
and about your meeting with Red Dragon.

147
00:09:46,127 --> 00:09:46,877
Damian.

148
00:09:48,170 --> 00:09:52,967
You told me you know what
kind of criminal Red Dragon is.

149
00:09:54,802 --> 00:09:57,221
Are you sure you don't know
her real identity?

150
00:09:58,681 --> 00:10:00,391
That she's Helena Montoya?

151
00:10:01,058 --> 00:10:03,394
[slow tense music playing]

152
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,525
Lily, I hope you can forgive me.

153
00:10:10,276 --> 00:10:11,736
I only wanted to protect you.

154
00:10:12,570 --> 00:10:13,946
Most especially you, Camia.

155
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:16,657
Damian, you've been living in our house.

156
00:10:17,033 --> 00:10:18,951
With me and Lily.

157
00:10:19,452 --> 00:10:22,204
You witnessed what my daughter
had to go through

158
00:10:22,288 --> 00:10:24,749
just to discover
Red Dragon's real identity.

159
00:10:25,207 --> 00:10:27,293
But you still didn't tell us the truth.

160
00:10:28,544 --> 00:10:31,839
[slow tense piano music playing]

161
00:10:32,632 --> 00:10:34,467
Mercedes came to see me here.

162
00:10:35,092 --> 00:10:38,262
She threatened to kill the two
of you if I told you the truth.

163
00:10:39,305 --> 00:10:41,891
And because I was able
to get close to Red Dragon,

164
00:10:41,974 --> 00:10:44,226
I was able to find a way to protect Diego

165
00:10:44,310 --> 00:10:46,270
when he infiltrated her camp
disguised as Jaguar.

166
00:10:48,481 --> 00:10:51,859
[Camia] But you can't change
the fact that you betrayed us.

167
00:10:52,526 --> 00:10:54,487
Damian, you should've told us the truth.

168
00:10:55,613 --> 00:10:59,075
You shouldn't have lied to us.
We would have understood you.

169
00:11:00,368 --> 00:11:01,118
Camia.

170
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,955
Thank you for protecting us, Damian…

171
00:11:06,874 --> 00:11:08,668
but you betrayed me.

172
00:11:11,545 --> 00:11:13,255
-Mom.
-Damian, you hurt me!

173
00:11:15,674 --> 00:11:17,760
[tense piano music continues]

174
00:11:31,273 --> 00:11:37,113
Thank you for… trying to protect us,

175
00:11:38,781 --> 00:11:40,616
but for now,

176
00:11:41,575 --> 00:11:42,952
I think you should…

177
00:11:45,871 --> 00:11:46,956
I understand.

178
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,001
I'm leaving.

179
00:12:00,010 --> 00:12:00,761
[door closes]

180
00:12:01,887 --> 00:12:02,972
I just thought you should know,

181
00:12:03,973 --> 00:12:06,517
that Attorney Fisher
set an appointment with me.

182
00:12:07,435 --> 00:12:09,603
It looks like she's asking for a favor.

183
00:12:10,104 --> 00:12:11,564
[laughing]

184
00:12:12,231 --> 00:12:16,318
Well, at least they're
learning how to play.

185
00:12:17,153 --> 00:12:18,362
But then again,

186
00:12:19,029 --> 00:12:21,657
I'm not in the mood to play with them.

187
00:12:22,241 --> 00:12:25,161
They're way too serious.
They have no sense of humor.

188
00:12:25,244 --> 00:12:26,078
[laughing]

189
00:12:26,370 --> 00:12:28,164
This is what I want you to do, Judge.

190
00:12:28,706 --> 00:12:36,046
Shut out Lily Cruz
and that Attorney Fisher.

191
00:12:37,089 --> 00:12:38,757
Too bad about that lawyer.

192
00:12:39,383 --> 00:12:40,342
I find her really pretty.

193
00:12:40,426 --> 00:12:41,969
-That's true.
-And sexy.

194
00:12:42,678 --> 00:12:48,976
And in return for your troubles,
I give you this.

195
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:51,979
[suspenseful music playing]

196
00:12:54,315 --> 00:12:55,107
[laughs]

197
00:12:56,317 --> 00:12:59,069
In that case, there's nothing
left to talk about.

198
00:12:59,153 --> 00:13:03,782
I knew I was right about you.
You are a man of action.

199
00:13:03,866 --> 00:13:06,702
Of course. Thank you. Thank you.

200
00:13:06,785 --> 00:13:07,912
Have it.

201
00:13:13,417 --> 00:13:14,919
How's your mom doing?

202
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:18,047
She's upset.

203
00:13:21,091 --> 00:13:24,345
She feels really betrayed.

204
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:28,933
[somber piano music playing]

205
00:13:29,016 --> 00:13:29,808
Lily.

206
00:13:31,477 --> 00:13:33,812
I need to tell you something.
Please don't get upset with me.

207
00:13:37,191 --> 00:13:38,067
What is it?

208
00:13:40,152 --> 00:13:41,612
I saw Diego earlier.

209
00:13:42,154 --> 00:13:44,114
I wasn't planning on telling you,

210
00:13:44,823 --> 00:13:47,451
but you might get upset with me
if you discover the truth.

211
00:13:51,205 --> 00:13:52,957
He isn't ready to come back.

212
00:13:59,922 --> 00:14:00,798
Lily…

213
00:14:00,881 --> 00:14:02,216
I understand.

214
00:14:07,388 --> 00:14:08,973
But I know he's coming back.

215
00:14:11,100 --> 00:14:13,310
And I won't grow tired…

216
00:14:14,979 --> 00:14:16,814
of waiting for him to come back, Jepoy.

217
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,489
[ominous music playing]

218
00:14:39,044 --> 00:14:40,713
[paper rustling]

219
00:14:44,466 --> 00:14:45,885
-[thuds]
-Whoa!

220
00:14:46,719 --> 00:14:48,220
What the--?!

221
00:14:48,304 --> 00:14:49,805
Get out and check it out!

222
00:14:51,348 --> 00:14:53,726
[tense music playing]

223
00:14:57,021 --> 00:14:57,771
Governor.

224
00:14:58,355 --> 00:14:59,481
What is that?!

225
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:07,156
I'M COMING AFTER YOU NEXT!

226
00:15:08,198 --> 00:15:10,784
[tense music playing]

227
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,962
[music intensifies]

228
00:15:30,930 --> 00:15:31,805
Look.

229
00:15:33,557 --> 00:15:37,895
Look at your bastard son's handiwork.

230
00:15:38,395 --> 00:15:40,773
He'll always be a pest.

231
00:15:41,148 --> 00:15:42,483
[laughing]

232
00:15:42,942 --> 00:15:43,776
[Julio chuckles]

233
00:15:44,068 --> 00:15:47,655
Well, Emilia--
It's good to know you're amused.

234
00:15:49,073 --> 00:15:52,034
I just remember those times you laughed

235
00:15:52,117 --> 00:15:54,036
at my hallucinations of Lily Cruz.

236
00:15:54,119 --> 00:15:55,663
Now it's happening to you!

237
00:15:55,746 --> 00:15:56,872
[laughing]

238
00:15:57,665 --> 00:16:00,918
Your fear over Diego Torillo is legit.

239
00:16:01,001 --> 00:16:01,877
[laughing]

240
00:16:01,961 --> 00:16:02,962
Shut up!

241
00:16:04,546 --> 00:16:05,464
Raul,

242
00:16:06,715 --> 00:16:09,510
your son's horns are showing.

243
00:16:10,302 --> 00:16:11,971
And if you don't talk to him,

244
00:16:12,596 --> 00:16:15,265
I'll break off those horns myself.

245
00:16:15,641 --> 00:16:17,267
He's a different man now, Papa.

246
00:16:18,978 --> 00:16:23,774
My son has forgotten he was ever
a part of this family.

247
00:16:25,025 --> 00:16:26,944
He's forgotten
that you were ever his Grandpa.

248
00:16:27,903 --> 00:16:30,072
What if I forget that you're my husband?

249
00:16:30,322 --> 00:16:34,034
Now you have to choose
between Diego or the Ardientes.

250
00:16:34,368 --> 00:16:35,244
Choose.

251
00:16:35,953 --> 00:16:39,039
[tense music playing]

252
00:16:41,333 --> 00:16:42,126
[scoffs]

253
00:16:42,918 --> 00:16:44,378
Cat got your tongue again.

254
00:16:46,922 --> 00:16:49,591
I don't care about your husband, Emilia.

255
00:16:51,010 --> 00:16:55,514
All that matters is that
we stick together as a family.

256
00:16:56,056 --> 00:17:01,395
The blood coursing through
our veins is pure Ardiente.

257
00:17:03,313 --> 00:17:07,234
And I don't want the blood of my
grandson to be associated with

258
00:17:07,317 --> 00:17:12,072
and tainted by
that peasant vigilante, Diego.

259
00:17:12,364 --> 00:17:16,368
[tense music continues]

260
00:17:27,004 --> 00:17:29,006
[tense music playing]

261
00:17:38,432 --> 00:17:39,683
[inaudible]

262
00:17:46,398 --> 00:17:47,608
[inaudible]

263
00:17:48,609 --> 00:17:49,860
-[gunshot]
-[screams]

264
00:17:49,943 --> 00:17:54,156
-[breathing heavily]
-[tense music playing]

265
00:18:13,509 --> 00:18:14,676
[Emilia] <i>My son!</i>

266
00:18:15,052 --> 00:18:16,095
How are you?

267
00:18:16,178 --> 00:18:18,305
Come here. Come here. Oh, my baby boy.

268
00:18:19,890 --> 00:18:22,392
You're so thin and you're so…

269
00:18:22,768 --> 00:18:23,519
dark.

270
00:18:24,061 --> 00:18:26,396
Good grief, that's it, okay?
You're coming home.

271
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:28,690
-Jenny, get his room ready.
-There's no need.

272
00:18:28,774 --> 00:18:30,818
-I just want to talk to my grandfather.
-Okay.

273
00:18:31,485 --> 00:18:35,489
Arnaldo, even with bodyguards,
that hut doesn't suit you.

274
00:18:35,948 --> 00:18:38,242
Listen to me. You are an Ardiente.

275
00:18:38,325 --> 00:18:40,494
You are meant for greater things.

276
00:18:40,577 --> 00:18:44,123
You should come home
instead of acting all nice.

277
00:18:44,206 --> 00:18:45,332
I mean, look at you.

278
00:18:46,708 --> 00:18:48,460
You heard the man, Emilia.

279
00:18:51,255 --> 00:18:52,840
Leave my grandson to me.

280
00:18:53,715 --> 00:18:55,092
We have a lot to talk about.

281
00:18:55,968 --> 00:18:57,177
Okay. Bye.

282
00:18:58,971 --> 00:18:59,847
[sighing]

283
00:18:59,930 --> 00:19:01,014
You should come home soon.

284
00:19:03,058 --> 00:19:04,768
[slow tense music playing]

285
00:19:07,813 --> 00:19:09,398
[birds chirping]

286
00:19:09,481 --> 00:19:11,650
Make sure you do everything as instructed,

287
00:19:12,109 --> 00:19:14,278
especially concerning the documents.

288
00:19:14,862 --> 00:19:15,779
Yes, ma'am.

289
00:19:17,406 --> 00:19:19,408
Another package came in for you.

290
00:19:21,952 --> 00:19:23,787
[ominous sound]

291
00:19:24,705 --> 00:19:26,999
[tense music continues]

292
00:19:30,335 --> 00:19:32,963
Madam's messages have been
getting more frequent.

293
00:19:35,674 --> 00:19:37,801
I consulted her on a few matters.

294
00:19:47,227 --> 00:19:47,978
Leave.

295
00:20:05,913 --> 00:20:08,081
[Mercedes] <i>If you know yourself,</i>
<i>but not the enemy,</i>

296
00:20:08,874 --> 00:20:12,085
<i>for every victory gained,</i>
<i>you will also suffer defeat.</i>

297
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:14,129
<i>Know your enemy.</i>

298
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:17,674
<i>Fool them, and act in ways</i>
<i>they will never suspect.</i>

299
00:20:18,592 --> 00:20:21,136
<i>Only then will you achieve true victory.</i>

300
00:20:23,889 --> 00:20:25,474
[tense music continues]

301
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:31,188
[Mercedes] <i>Deliver the documents</i>
<i>to Red Dragon.</i>

302
00:20:31,772 --> 00:20:33,565
<i>But deliver them to the address</i>
<i>written below,</i>

303
00:20:33,649 --> 00:20:35,108
<i>not to the first one mentioned,</i>

304
00:20:35,984 --> 00:20:37,903
<i>so that the enemy cannot track them.</i>

305
00:20:41,907 --> 00:20:46,245
You've always been smart at
doing the unpredictable, Madam.

306
00:20:47,287 --> 00:20:48,413
As you wish.

307
00:20:48,956 --> 00:20:50,958
[tense music playing]

308
00:21:07,557 --> 00:21:08,892
Would you like to join me?

309
00:21:09,643 --> 00:21:13,230
Grandpa, I think we should pray
for Colonel Sanggano's soul.

310
00:21:13,313 --> 00:21:14,231
Arnaldo.

311
00:21:15,607 --> 00:21:18,944
I'm not disrespecting you,
but can that wait?

312
00:21:19,027 --> 00:21:23,407
There's something more important
you should know.

313
00:21:24,533 --> 00:21:27,327
The identity of Sanggano's killer.

314
00:21:29,079 --> 00:21:33,125
It was none other
than your wonderful brother,

315
00:21:33,208 --> 00:21:34,626
Diego Torillo.

316
00:21:35,544 --> 00:21:37,963
He's the one who killed Sanggano.

317
00:21:39,298 --> 00:21:44,636
You know, a lot of people
think I'm bad. That I'm evil.

318
00:21:45,220 --> 00:21:47,681
But what they don't know is,
between me and Diego,

319
00:21:48,682 --> 00:21:51,143
he's way more of a criminal
than I've ever been.

320
00:21:51,226 --> 00:21:52,894
I don't believe what you're saying.

321
00:21:52,978 --> 00:21:55,063
Diego's such a kind person.
He wouldn't do that.

322
00:21:55,522 --> 00:21:58,608
His kind is nothing
but a bunch of murderers!

323
00:22:00,610 --> 00:22:05,032
I'm not mad at you, Arnaldo.
I'm just stressing the fact.

324
00:22:05,949 --> 00:22:07,034
I'm your grandfather.

325
00:22:07,451 --> 00:22:08,952
[in English] I'm your grandfather.

326
00:22:09,244 --> 00:22:12,706
I'm the only one who you can trust.

327
00:22:13,415 --> 00:22:16,043
Because I only have your welfare in mind.

328
00:22:16,126 --> 00:22:17,169
Nothing else.

329
00:22:17,544 --> 00:22:21,298
All I want is whatever
will be good for you.

330
00:22:22,632 --> 00:22:25,010
So please, I'm begging you.

331
00:22:25,093 --> 00:22:31,141
Leave that ratty house
and those fields and come home.

332
00:22:31,933 --> 00:22:36,480
Live where a proper prince
like you should live.

333
00:22:37,731 --> 00:22:39,149
Stay here, in our palace.

334
00:22:39,649 --> 00:22:42,027
I already told you I'm not coming home,

335
00:22:42,110 --> 00:22:43,195
and that hasn't changed.

336
00:22:43,278 --> 00:22:44,029
[sighs]

337
00:22:44,780 --> 00:22:47,032
I came because I have
a lot of questions, and…

338
00:22:49,242 --> 00:22:50,952
I think you might be able to answer them.

339
00:22:51,411 --> 00:22:52,913
I have a lot to ask about…

340
00:22:54,581 --> 00:22:55,373
about Lily.

341
00:22:56,500 --> 00:22:57,584
And if you can answer them--

342
00:22:57,667 --> 00:22:58,627
You'll come back.

343
00:22:58,877 --> 00:23:00,045
[tense music playing]

344
00:23:00,420 --> 00:23:01,171
You see?

345
00:23:01,963 --> 00:23:03,590
I'm right.

346
00:23:04,883 --> 00:23:07,511
You have it in you. It's natural.

347
00:23:08,303 --> 00:23:12,766
It's natural for an Ardiente
to be a great negotiator.

348
00:23:14,518 --> 00:23:16,645
Okay? You'll come back.

349
00:23:20,398 --> 00:23:21,441
Do we have a deal?

350
00:23:26,488 --> 00:23:30,075
I will answer all your questions.

351
00:23:33,620 --> 00:23:35,705
But you have to come back home.

352
00:23:38,625 --> 00:23:39,960
[music intensifies]

353
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:46,633
That's my grandson.

354
00:23:47,968 --> 00:23:49,970
[tense music continues]

355
00:23:58,979 --> 00:24:00,647
[suspenseful music playing]

356
00:24:18,707 --> 00:24:20,458
Red Dragon wants to see me privately.

357
00:24:20,542 --> 00:24:22,210
So, you two stay here.

358
00:24:52,324 --> 00:24:55,118
Madam, here are your files.

359
00:24:58,705 --> 00:25:01,625
[suspenseful music continues]

360
00:25:13,970 --> 00:25:15,430
[music swells]

361
00:25:22,187 --> 00:25:23,980
[in Chinese] Hello, Mercedes.

362
00:25:24,731 --> 00:25:25,523
You?!

363
00:25:26,149 --> 00:25:28,360
Yes, Mercedes. It's me.

364
00:25:30,278 --> 00:25:32,447
[tense music playing]

365
00:25:39,162 --> 00:25:41,790
[Lily] <i>If you know yourself</i>
<i>but not the enemy,</i>

366
00:25:45,210 --> 00:25:47,170
<i>for every victory gained,</i>

367
00:25:52,092 --> 00:25:54,052
<i>you will also suffer a defeat.</i>

368
00:25:57,430 --> 00:25:59,557
[henchwoman] <i>Mercedes, this came in.</i>

369
00:26:05,397 --> 00:26:06,648
It's just how I am.

370
00:26:08,066 --> 00:26:12,487
I make sure I know my enemies well.

371
00:26:14,072 --> 00:26:17,492
From the head down to the toes.

372
00:26:18,326 --> 00:26:20,870
So that I can camouflage as the enemy.

373
00:26:22,289 --> 00:26:23,957
Where's Red Dragon?

374
00:26:24,874 --> 00:26:26,251
Mm… [laughing]

375
00:26:26,918 --> 00:26:28,420
I don't know where she is.

376
00:26:29,504 --> 00:26:31,798
But if you still don't get it, Mercedes,

377
00:26:31,881 --> 00:26:35,385
I was the one sending you letters.

378
00:26:35,468 --> 00:26:38,263
[tense music playing]

379
00:26:44,352 --> 00:26:46,271
[in Chinese] Thank you, Mercedes.

380
00:26:52,736 --> 00:26:54,321
-[grunts]
-[tense music playing]

381
00:26:54,738 --> 00:26:55,739
[grunts]

382
00:26:56,865 --> 00:26:57,615
[thuds]

383
00:27:06,624 --> 00:27:07,459
[grunts]

384
00:27:09,961 --> 00:27:11,796
[tense music continues]

385
00:27:23,141 --> 00:27:25,727
[people screaming]

386
00:27:33,693 --> 00:27:37,113
So, Mercedes, tell me,
what's the passcode?

387
00:27:37,530 --> 00:27:39,199
There is no passcode.

388
00:27:40,158 --> 00:27:42,369
Mercedes, you had the vault prepared.

389
00:27:42,452 --> 00:27:43,244
Remember?

390
00:27:45,413 --> 00:27:46,539
[Mercedes] <i>Sahara.</i>

391
00:27:46,998 --> 00:27:48,458
<i>Yes, Madam Mercedes.</i>

392
00:27:48,541 --> 00:27:50,001
<i>Prepare the vault.</i>

393
00:27:50,752 --> 00:27:51,753
[Sahara] <i>Yes, Madam.</i>

394
00:27:53,546 --> 00:27:55,048
[suspenseful music playing]

395
00:27:55,882 --> 00:27:58,343
Aren't you an expert in hacking?

396
00:27:58,426 --> 00:27:59,844
Just like what you did to my laptop?

397
00:27:59,928 --> 00:28:04,432
Go ahead. Have a field day
finding the key to the vault.

398
00:28:04,516 --> 00:28:06,393
-Enjoy!
-No!

399
00:28:06,476 --> 00:28:09,229
This conversation won't be over
until you tell me the passcode!

400
00:28:09,312 --> 00:28:10,397
[people screaming]

401
00:28:18,363 --> 00:28:19,948
[tense action music playing]

402
00:28:36,965 --> 00:28:38,842
[whooshing]

403
00:28:45,140 --> 00:28:47,267
[grunting]

404
00:28:47,892 --> 00:28:48,643
[thuds]

405
00:29:00,947 --> 00:29:02,574
[tense action music continues]

406
00:29:07,537 --> 00:29:08,538
[grunts]

407
00:29:21,885 --> 00:29:24,220
[grunting continuously]

408
00:29:25,680 --> 00:29:26,598
[Lily coughing]

409
00:29:33,313 --> 00:29:36,149
[suspenseful music playing]

410
00:29:50,705 --> 00:29:52,999
[grunting]

411
00:30:01,591 --> 00:30:03,551
[action music playing]

412
00:30:10,975 --> 00:30:12,560
[thuds]

413
00:30:29,702 --> 00:30:33,331
So… You still won't give me
the passcode, huh?

414
00:30:33,581 --> 00:30:34,332
No!

415
00:30:34,499 --> 00:30:37,460
I would rather die than
give Lily Cruz what she wants.

416
00:30:40,922 --> 00:30:44,509
Okay. Looks like you really mean it.

417
00:30:45,009 --> 00:30:46,511
So, I'll give you that.

418
00:30:47,178 --> 00:30:51,140
Besides, the evidence I got
is more than enough.

419
00:30:52,517 --> 00:30:53,643
[grunts]

420
00:30:58,773 --> 00:30:59,566
[Mercedes grunting]

421
00:31:04,696 --> 00:31:06,406
[in Chinese] Thank you, Mercedes.

422
00:31:07,031 --> 00:31:08,283
[in Chinese] I won.

423
00:31:19,043 --> 00:31:20,587
[tense music playing]

424
00:31:20,670 --> 00:31:21,796
To start off,

425
00:31:22,505 --> 00:31:25,842
here is a big answer
to one of your questions.

426
00:31:29,637 --> 00:31:31,347
[tense music intensifies]

427
00:31:33,349 --> 00:31:34,684
[Arnaldo] We were married?

428
00:31:34,767 --> 00:31:38,021
[Julio] You were supposed to be,
but it was a big trap

429
00:31:38,104 --> 00:31:46,321
to humiliate our whole family
to the entire town.

430
00:31:47,697 --> 00:31:51,200
Truth is, you were their main target.

431
00:31:51,284 --> 00:31:52,785
They wanted to humiliate you.

432
00:31:52,869 --> 00:31:57,290
They hurt you and totally
destroyed your dignity.

433
00:31:59,500 --> 00:32:02,962
And everything was planned
by none other than that woman,

434
00:32:03,338 --> 00:32:09,469
Lily Cruz, whom you used to know
as Ivy Aguas.

435
00:32:09,677 --> 00:32:11,638
And she didn't do it by herself.

436
00:32:12,055 --> 00:32:15,183
She got help from your brother Diego.

437
00:32:15,642 --> 00:32:21,940
They planned to bring you down
and crush our entire family.

438
00:32:22,607 --> 00:32:23,816
Yes, it's true.

439
00:32:24,192 --> 00:32:29,948
You got that woman first,
but Diego took her from you.

440
00:32:30,531 --> 00:32:32,283
That's how sly your brother is.

441
00:32:33,701 --> 00:32:37,205
Lily Cruz lied to you, and so did Diego.

442
00:32:37,914 --> 00:32:40,458
Those two ganged up on you.

443
00:32:41,793 --> 00:32:44,003
They were conniving all along.

444
00:32:47,799 --> 00:32:49,884
Now, you see how vile they are?

445
00:32:50,802 --> 00:32:53,054
[tense music playing]

446
00:32:55,139 --> 00:32:56,975
They are evil!

447
00:33:02,605 --> 00:33:05,358
[citizens yelling]

448
00:33:05,441 --> 00:33:06,651
<i>Stop! Wait! Wait! Wait!</i>

449
00:33:07,151 --> 00:33:08,236
<i>Everyone, calm down.</i>

450
00:33:08,319 --> 00:33:10,405
<i>Thanks for helping me out.</i>

451
00:33:10,488 --> 00:33:12,281
<i>I appreciate that you're checking on me.</i>

452
00:33:12,365 --> 00:33:13,574
<i>Thank you so much.</i>

453
00:33:13,658 --> 00:33:15,326
<i>You're really kind, Diego.</i>

454
00:33:17,286 --> 00:33:18,913
[somber piano music playing]

455
00:33:21,416 --> 00:33:22,208
[crying]

456
00:33:22,709 --> 00:33:23,543
Arnaldo.

457
00:33:25,128 --> 00:33:25,878
Arnaldo.

458
00:33:26,087 --> 00:33:27,005
Arnaldo, my boy.

459
00:33:27,088 --> 00:33:28,214
[crying]

460
00:33:28,297 --> 00:33:29,048
Relax.

461
00:33:29,382 --> 00:33:32,468
I know it's a lot to take in.
Relax, relax. You're home.

462
00:33:32,552 --> 00:33:33,928
You're home. Jenny!

463
00:33:34,429 --> 00:33:35,680
Jenny, get me a glass of water!

464
00:33:36,764 --> 00:33:38,433
Relax. Relax, my boy. Relax.

465
00:33:39,017 --> 00:33:39,892
Relax.

466
00:33:40,935 --> 00:33:42,020
I'm here. I'm here.

467
00:33:42,103 --> 00:33:43,271
I'll take care of you.

468
00:33:43,730 --> 00:33:45,023
You're home. You're home.

469
00:33:46,357 --> 00:33:48,484
[somber piano music continues]

470
00:33:56,117 --> 00:33:59,787
I'm about to reclaim my office, Arnaldo.

471
00:34:01,539 --> 00:34:06,169
An office which you will inherit.

472
00:34:07,920 --> 00:34:09,839
That's why you need to come back.

473
00:34:10,965 --> 00:34:16,262
Come back so we can take Diego down.

474
00:34:17,972 --> 00:34:19,390
[ominous music playing]

475
00:34:19,474 --> 00:34:21,142
You have to come back.

476
00:34:25,563 --> 00:34:29,025
I'll put a stop to your plans,
Julio Ardiente.

477
00:34:30,902 --> 00:34:33,529
My brother will stand by my side and I…

478
00:34:34,864 --> 00:34:39,035
I will be the governor of Ardiente.

479
00:34:39,911 --> 00:34:42,413
Me! Not you!

480
00:34:44,290 --> 00:34:45,041
[gunshot]

481
00:34:46,125 --> 00:34:47,001
[gunshot]

482
00:34:49,962 --> 00:34:53,716
[ominous music continues]

483
00:34:56,886 --> 00:34:57,970
[gasping]

484
00:34:59,388 --> 00:35:00,181
[grunts]

485
00:35:02,308 --> 00:35:04,685
[tense music playing]

486
00:35:08,981 --> 00:35:13,111
You have no right to invade
my sanity, Diego.

487
00:35:15,238 --> 00:35:17,365
I'll be the one to end you.

488
00:35:17,782 --> 00:35:18,658
[exhales sharply]

489
00:35:28,292 --> 00:35:29,585
The evidence is strong.

490
00:35:29,961 --> 00:35:31,587
Helena Montoya is Red Dragon.

491
00:35:31,671 --> 00:35:33,631
But… there's something missing.

492
00:35:34,465 --> 00:35:35,508
What, Attorney?

493
00:35:35,591 --> 00:35:39,095
Bank accounts that will prove
how big their operation is.

494
00:35:39,470 --> 00:35:44,517
Then we will need a list
of Red Dragon's present clients.

495
00:35:46,435 --> 00:35:50,022
Lists, bank accounts,
whatever you need, I'll find it.

496
00:35:50,356 --> 00:35:52,024
I'll get it from them, Attorney.

497
00:35:52,108 --> 00:35:52,984
[tense music playing]

498
00:35:53,067 --> 00:35:55,236
We will expose Red Dragon.

499
00:35:58,281 --> 00:36:02,326
And we will put a stop
to all her operations.

500
00:36:04,370 --> 00:36:07,748
[suspenseful music playing]

501
00:36:11,377 --> 00:36:13,129
Does Red Dragon know?

502
00:36:14,380 --> 00:36:15,214
[door closes]

503
00:36:15,298 --> 00:36:17,466
Yes, and she's not happy, Mercedes.

504
00:36:18,676 --> 00:36:20,720
I need to do something.

505
00:36:21,429 --> 00:36:25,933
Red Dragon knows that Diego
killed Colonel Sanggano

506
00:36:26,017 --> 00:36:32,523
and that Julio Ardiente can't
sleep at night because of it.

507
00:36:33,482 --> 00:36:34,233
And?

508
00:36:34,817 --> 00:36:38,070
Red Dragon wants to recruit
Diego Torillo into the group.

509
00:36:38,946 --> 00:36:40,990
[dramatic music playing]

510
00:36:43,659 --> 00:36:44,994
Colonel Magbanua.

511
00:36:46,329 --> 00:36:49,248
I do hope that you'll prove
to be a lot more competent

512
00:36:49,332 --> 00:36:52,001
than that good-for-nothing
Colonel Sanggano.

513
00:36:53,336 --> 00:36:54,086
Now,

514
00:36:54,962 --> 00:36:59,967
your first mission as my right-hand man

515
00:37:00,051 --> 00:37:03,387
is to hunt down Diego Torillo.

516
00:37:03,846 --> 00:37:08,726
I don't know how that man is still alive.

517
00:37:09,352 --> 00:37:11,729
That Diego Torillo can pray if he wants,

518
00:37:12,605 --> 00:37:14,357
but that won't save him from me.

519
00:37:15,900 --> 00:37:16,692
Brilliant.

520
00:37:17,944 --> 00:37:19,195
Now then,

521
00:37:19,987 --> 00:37:20,947
Judge Lustre,

522
00:37:21,948 --> 00:37:22,949
where were we?

523
00:37:24,659 --> 00:37:26,077
This is not good.

524
00:37:26,953 --> 00:37:29,747
You can't have a death threat

525
00:37:30,289 --> 00:37:31,958
while we're preparing your reinstatement.

526
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:36,796
I'm just worried you might be distracted.

527
00:37:39,006 --> 00:37:45,221
Judge, a push-over like
Diego Torillo can't scare me.

528
00:37:47,014 --> 00:37:51,227
Mark my words, the moment
I reclaim my throne,

529
00:37:52,979 --> 00:37:57,525
Diego Torillo, Helena Montoya, Lily Cruz…

530
00:37:58,109 --> 00:38:01,904
I'll throw their heads in the dumpster.

531
00:38:03,531 --> 00:38:05,074
Mark my words.

532
00:38:06,409 --> 00:38:09,120
[tense music playing]

533
00:38:12,957 --> 00:38:14,250
Diego Torillo?

534
00:38:14,917 --> 00:38:16,085
Why him?

535
00:38:16,794 --> 00:38:19,171
Not even Emilia could join us.

536
00:38:19,755 --> 00:38:23,217
What help can Diego Torillo
possibly offer?

537
00:38:25,678 --> 00:38:28,055
[suspenseful music playing]

538
00:38:35,187 --> 00:38:36,272
<i>Mercedes.</i>

539
00:38:36,939 --> 00:38:41,193
I'll use Diego Torillo
against Julio, obviously.

540
00:38:42,528 --> 00:38:43,404
<i>But the most</i>

541
00:38:43,487 --> 00:38:47,408
important thing is that
this is the perfect venue

542
00:38:47,491 --> 00:38:50,036
<i>to get revenge on Lily Cruz.</i>

543
00:38:50,786 --> 00:38:52,621
<i>For what she did to my daughter,</i>

544
00:38:52,705 --> 00:38:55,291
for stealing those files,

545
00:38:55,374 --> 00:38:59,211
and for trying to infiltrate
in our organization.

546
00:38:59,295 --> 00:39:02,131
<i>There's nothing more painful</i>
<i>than trying to see</i>

547
00:39:02,214 --> 00:39:05,092
<i>your loved one enter the enemy zone.</i>

548
00:39:05,801 --> 00:39:09,138
And while we're corrupting Diego Torillo,

549
00:39:10,181 --> 00:39:13,142
it will only make it worse for Lily Cruz.

550
00:39:14,602 --> 00:39:17,063
<i>And once he's really corrupted,</i>

551
00:39:17,980 --> 00:39:19,815
that's when we'll kill him

552
00:39:20,608 --> 00:39:22,818
because he'll know too much.

553
00:39:23,569 --> 00:39:25,363
<i>And don't think of asking where I am.</i>

554
00:39:26,530 --> 00:39:28,657
<i>Listen closely, Mercedes.</i>

555
00:39:29,116 --> 00:39:33,704
This is your last chance
to redeem yourself.

556
00:39:35,748 --> 00:39:37,750
<i>Recruit Diego Torillo</i>

557
00:39:38,918 --> 00:39:39,919
or die!

558
00:39:40,628 --> 00:39:44,173
[tense music playing]

559
00:39:53,516 --> 00:39:55,434
[birds chirping]

560
00:40:09,657 --> 00:40:12,868
[suspenseful music playing]

561
00:40:19,417 --> 00:40:20,960
I got your message.

562
00:40:23,421 --> 00:40:24,839
What do you want from me?

563
00:40:26,298 --> 00:40:29,051
For a fugitive,
you're not difficult to find.

564
00:40:30,469 --> 00:40:31,762
But then again,

565
00:40:32,138 --> 00:40:37,351
what reason do you need
if you really want something?

566
00:40:43,607 --> 00:40:45,359
Red Dragon extends you her invitation

567
00:40:45,901 --> 00:40:47,695
to join our organization.

568
00:40:48,946 --> 00:40:50,906
You will be paid handsomely.

569
00:40:51,407 --> 00:40:53,951
And you wouldn't have to hide

570
00:40:54,368 --> 00:40:56,996
from the people hunting you
for Sanggano's death.

571
00:40:57,955 --> 00:41:00,332
You'll also get revenge on Julio Ardiente

572
00:41:00,416 --> 00:41:02,209
for killing your foster parents.

573
00:41:05,963 --> 00:41:08,424
If there's anyone
who can defeat Julio Ardiente,

574
00:41:09,175 --> 00:41:11,385
it's definitely Red Dragon.

575
00:41:14,263 --> 00:41:15,473
[Mercedes] <i>I can go on and on.</i>

576
00:41:16,390 --> 00:41:17,892
But we don't have all day.

577
00:41:18,642 --> 00:41:19,727
What do you say?

578
00:41:23,981 --> 00:41:24,940
[gunshot]

579
00:41:26,734 --> 00:41:27,735
[gunshot]

580
00:41:29,695 --> 00:41:30,905
[Diego] <i>I promise you this,</i>

581
00:41:30,988 --> 00:41:32,072
<i>Julio Ardiente,</i>

582
00:41:32,156 --> 00:41:36,744
<i>You'll pay for what you did</i>
<i>to my foster parents!</i>

583
00:41:37,369 --> 00:41:38,996
<i>I'll bring you down!</i>

584
00:41:39,371 --> 00:41:40,998
[Lily] <i>If you could only see yourself…</i>

585
00:41:41,373 --> 00:41:44,376
<i>It's like you're ready to kill!</i>
<i>And I won't let you do that!</i>

586
00:41:44,460 --> 00:41:46,086
<i>I won't let you turn into a criminal!</i>

587
00:41:46,170 --> 00:41:49,340
<i>There's no place for justice</i>
<i>here in Ardiente!</i>

588
00:41:49,423 --> 00:41:50,341
<i>I will kill them.</i>

589
00:41:50,424 --> 00:41:51,300
<i>Diego!</i>

590
00:41:52,510 --> 00:41:53,469
[gunshot]

591
00:41:56,889 --> 00:41:59,808
[suspenseful music playing]

592
00:42:06,398 --> 00:42:07,483
I accept.

593
00:42:09,318 --> 00:42:10,819
But not so I can be your pet.

594
00:42:12,154 --> 00:42:13,572
[tense music playing]

595
00:42:17,618 --> 00:42:19,411
You know what I'm capable of.

596
00:42:21,080 --> 00:42:22,957
So, what do you propose?

597
00:42:24,250 --> 00:42:26,418
I won't join your group as an underling.

598
00:42:31,006 --> 00:42:33,384
I want to join as Red Dragon's ally.

599
00:42:34,009 --> 00:42:35,219
Her ally?

600
00:42:57,074 --> 00:42:58,492
[Helena] <i>Diego Torillo.</i>

601
00:43:00,744 --> 00:43:02,621
What can you bring to the table

602
00:43:02,705 --> 00:43:05,874
to prove you deserve to be my ally?

603
00:43:08,294 --> 00:43:09,169
Hmm…

604
00:43:09,253 --> 00:43:11,714
[tense music continues]

605
00:43:28,105 --> 00:43:29,148
If you decline,

606
00:43:30,441 --> 00:43:31,859
then I won't force you.

607
00:43:51,086 --> 00:43:51,962
[mobile phone ringing]

608
00:43:52,546 --> 00:43:53,422
Yes, Madam?

609
00:43:53,797 --> 00:43:54,715
Mercedes.

610
00:43:57,426 --> 00:43:58,344
Diego!

611
00:43:59,803 --> 00:44:01,263
[tense music playing]

612
00:44:05,351 --> 00:44:07,686
Welcome to the organization
as Red Dragon's ally.

613
00:44:38,967 --> 00:44:40,803
What?! Diego Torillo?

614
00:44:41,178 --> 00:44:42,346
<i>That Diego Torillo</i>

615
00:44:42,429 --> 00:44:43,597
was made an ally?

616
00:44:43,681 --> 00:44:45,683
-Does Mama know?
-Yes, Madam.

617
00:44:45,766 --> 00:44:47,643
The order came from Red Dragon herself.

618
00:44:48,143 --> 00:44:49,770
This is unbelievable.

619
00:44:50,062 --> 00:44:53,482
And it's all Mercedes' fault.
She got pissed off

620
00:44:53,565 --> 00:44:55,859
when I stormed into
your office the other day,

621
00:44:55,943 --> 00:44:57,277
<i>and now this happens.</i>

622
00:44:57,361 --> 00:44:58,237
<i>Okay.</i>

623
00:44:58,320 --> 00:45:01,365
I want you to continue
spying for me over there.

624
00:45:01,448 --> 00:45:02,741
I'll wire you money.

625
00:45:06,370 --> 00:45:07,287
[Raul] <i>Diego?</i>

626
00:45:08,038 --> 00:45:10,541
<i>They're recruiting Diego to</i>
<i>become Emilia's mother's ally?</i>

627
00:45:11,458 --> 00:45:13,085
[tense music playing]

628
00:45:17,840 --> 00:45:18,966
[line ringing]

629
00:45:20,300 --> 00:45:22,511
Hello, Mama. Come on, pick up the phone.

630
00:45:22,970 --> 00:45:24,471
How can you not consider my feelings

631
00:45:24,555 --> 00:45:25,806
in getting that Diego Torillo?!

632
00:45:25,889 --> 00:45:28,142
You know how much I hate that guy!

633
00:45:28,600 --> 00:45:29,476
Pick up the--

634
00:45:29,768 --> 00:45:30,519
[grunts]

635
00:45:30,936 --> 00:45:31,895
[sighs]

636
00:45:37,526 --> 00:45:38,694
That Diego Torillo

637
00:45:38,777 --> 00:45:41,530
doesn't deserve to be
an ally of Red Dragon!

638
00:45:44,158 --> 00:45:46,493
[Raul] <i>So, Helena Montoya is Red Dragon.</i>

639
00:45:48,036 --> 00:45:50,581
[suspenseful music playing]

640
00:46:02,468 --> 00:46:03,927
[line ringing]

641
00:46:07,973 --> 00:46:09,016
[line ringing]

642
00:46:15,481 --> 00:46:16,523
[line ringing]

643
00:46:20,986 --> 00:46:22,070
[line ringing]

644
00:46:34,583 --> 00:46:35,375
[door closes]

645
00:46:38,420 --> 00:46:39,296
Who are you?

646
00:46:39,463 --> 00:46:40,964
The name's Colonel Magbanua.

647
00:46:41,548 --> 00:46:42,883
Is Diego Torillo here?

648
00:46:43,800 --> 00:46:45,344
We're here to arrest him

649
00:46:45,427 --> 00:46:47,554
for murdering our comrade,
Colonel Sanggano.

650
00:46:47,971 --> 00:46:49,806
You're one of Julio Ardiente's henchmen?

651
00:46:50,516 --> 00:46:53,393
Then tell your boss that Diego isn't here.

652
00:46:55,646 --> 00:46:56,438
[Lily] Mom?

653
00:46:59,441 --> 00:47:00,651
What's going on here?

654
00:47:02,778 --> 00:47:06,281
Good evening! Good evening, Lily Cruz.

655
00:47:06,532 --> 00:47:10,702
I'd like you to know
that all your bodyguards are…

656
00:47:11,286 --> 00:47:14,331
being held at gunpoint by my men.

657
00:47:15,207 --> 00:47:17,543
It's just you and your mother now.

658
00:47:17,626 --> 00:47:21,505
Two women, plus your nincompoop
driver at the back.

659
00:47:23,131 --> 00:47:25,133
Meanwhile, I have 10 of my men here,

660
00:47:25,217 --> 00:47:28,971
so I think it'd be better
if you just let us inside.

661
00:47:29,221 --> 00:47:33,475
One more step, Julio Ardiente,
and you'll regret it.

662
00:47:35,143 --> 00:47:37,980
[tense music playing]

663
00:47:43,068 --> 00:47:44,444
[Julio laughing]

664
00:47:46,154 --> 00:47:49,866
Lily, let's not waste time here.

665
00:47:49,950 --> 00:47:52,327
Surrender Diego Torillo to me

666
00:47:52,953 --> 00:47:57,749
and I will leave
your premises peacefully, okay?

667
00:47:57,833 --> 00:47:59,084
-[Julio] Come on.
-Okay.

668
00:47:59,167 --> 00:48:00,961
-[gunshot]
-[Julio] Whoa!

669
00:48:01,044 --> 00:48:02,004
[Julio] Look!

670
00:48:02,504 --> 00:48:03,755
What was that for, Lily?!

671
00:48:07,426 --> 00:48:09,052
You almost hit my foot!

672
00:48:09,595 --> 00:48:12,306
Have you gone deaf, old man?

673
00:48:12,389 --> 00:48:14,975
I said if you take one
more step, you'll regret it.

674
00:48:15,809 --> 00:48:18,228
Diego Torillo isn't here.

675
00:48:18,312 --> 00:48:20,606
And when I say something, I mean it.

676
00:48:21,315 --> 00:48:22,149
As for you…

677
00:48:23,025 --> 00:48:26,194
We haven't been introduced
but now you'll know who I am.

678
00:48:26,278 --> 00:48:28,405
I am Lily Cruz.

679
00:48:28,905 --> 00:48:32,326
And if you stand in my way,
you'll be sorry!

680
00:48:33,910 --> 00:48:37,497
[tense music playing]

681
00:48:40,375 --> 00:48:43,295
This is crazy! We outnumber them.

682
00:48:43,378 --> 00:48:44,421
Come on!

683
00:48:44,504 --> 00:48:46,506
[rapid gunfire]

684
00:48:46,590 --> 00:48:48,800
Whoa! Stop it!

685
00:48:51,762 --> 00:48:52,596
[Lily] Now…

686
00:48:52,679 --> 00:48:54,264
-Whoa!
-If you insist on entering.

687
00:48:54,348 --> 00:48:55,349
[gun cocks]

688
00:48:55,432 --> 00:48:57,768
-[Julio] Whoa!
-[tense music playing]

689
00:48:58,477 --> 00:49:01,480
Just walk this way, Julio Ardiente.

690
00:49:01,563 --> 00:49:04,900
I won't think twice
about blowing your brains out.

691
00:49:05,776 --> 00:49:08,904
[suspenseful music playing]

692
00:49:17,954 --> 00:49:19,498
[Arnaldo] <i>I can't take it anymore!</i>

693
00:49:19,581 --> 00:49:22,417
<i>Lily. Take me to Lily.</i>
<i>I need to talk to her.</i>

694
00:49:23,377 --> 00:49:24,419
[chuckles] <i>Ivy.</i>

695
00:49:25,337 --> 00:49:26,755
[Diego] <i>I'm here for my mission,</i>

696
00:49:26,838 --> 00:49:28,465
<i>to bring down the Ardientes.</i>

697
00:49:28,548 --> 00:49:31,885
[Romulo] <i>I hope Red Dragon</i>
<i>was right to recruit you.</i>

698
00:49:31,968 --> 00:49:35,472
[Julio] <i>Even if you band</i>
<i>together with all my enemies,</i>

699
00:49:35,555 --> 00:49:38,100
<i>you are not going to shake me down.</i>

700
00:49:38,183 --> 00:49:41,311
<i>Bring me Diego Torillo. The war has begun.</i>

701
00:49:41,853 --> 00:49:46,441
[Helena] <i>I want you to kill Lily Cruz.</i>

702
00:49:46,525 --> 00:49:48,276
[suspenseful music playing]

703
00:49:51,029 --> 00:49:54,116
[theme music playing]
